---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Be In It | T-Time Media"
  description="T-Time Series is becoming a real production. If you want to be part of it, on camera or behind the scenes, start here."
  ogPath="/be-in-it"
  ogImage="/thumbs/be-in-it.png"
>
  <Header />

  <!-- ================= BE IN IT ================= -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Casting</h2>
      <p class="page-title">Be in it</p>
      <p class="lede">T-Time Series runs on real stories, not just Dominic's, and that only works if the range is real.</p>
      <div class="two-col" style="margin-bottom:44px;">
        <div>
          <p>I'm looking for trans men and transmasculine people across race, age, body type, class, sexuality, and background, whether or not you've medically transitioned, whether or not you "pass." As T-Time Series turns into a real production, I'm looking for two kinds of people: those open to an on-camera interview or segment, and those who want to help behind the scenes as it comes together. Before anything is published, here is what you're agreeing to and what you keep.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="terms">
            <li><b>Written permission first.</b> Nothing runs without it.</li>
            <li><b>You set the detail level.</b> Full name, first name, or none.</li>
            <li><b>You can withdraw.</b> Before or after publication, no reason needed.</li>
            <li><b>No location giveaways.</b> Backgrounds get checked before posting.</li>
            <li><b>You see it first.</b> Nothing is published you haven't approved.</li>
            <li><b>Adults only.</b> T-Time Series does not feature minors.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-banner form-banner-success" data-fs-success>
        ✓ Thanks for getting in touch. I'll write back soon with next steps.
      </div>
      <div class="form-banner form-banner-error" data-fs-error></div>

      <form id="bein-form" data-fs-frm>
        <label class="checkbox-field">
          <input type="checkbox" name="age_confirmation" required data-fs-field>
          I confirm I am 18 or older
        </label>
        <span data-fs-error="age_confirmation"></span>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="involvement">How would you like to be involved?</label>
          <select name="involvement_type" id="involvement" required data-fs-field>
            <option value="">Select one</option>
            <option value="on_camera">On-camera interview or segment</option>
            <option value="production_help">Behind-the-scenes / production help</option>
            <option value="not_sure">Not sure yet</option>
          </select>
          <span data-fs-error="involvement_type"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="name">What should I call you?</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required data-fs-field>
          <span data-fs-error="name"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required data-fs-field>
          <span data-fs-error="email"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="city">City or region <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="city" name="city" data-fs-field>
          <span data-fs-error="city"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="message">Anything else you want me to know? <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" data-fs-field></textarea>
          <span data-fs-error="message"></span>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn-accent" type="submit" data-fs-submit-btn>Start the conversation</button>
      </form>

      <p class="fineprint">This is a first hello, not a commitment. I'll write back with questions before anything gets made.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />

  <!-- Formspree AJAX Integration - Be In It Form -->
  <script is:inline>
    window.formspree = window.formspree || function () { (formspree.q = formspree.q || []).push(arguments); };
    formspree('initForm', { formElement: '#bein-form', formId: 'mwlewkov' });
  </script>
  <script is:inline src="https://unpkg.com/@formspree/ajax@1" defer></script>
</Layout>
